From: Financial Crime Compliance <fcc@example-bank.com>
To: Onboarding Programme <onboarding@example-bank.com>
Subject: Non-negotiables for the onboarding redesign
Date: Wed, 22 Oct 2026 15:40:00 +0000
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

1. Every director and beneficial owner above 25% ownership must pass identity verification and sanctions/PEP screening before an account is opened.
2. Screening results and the evidence used must be retained for 5 years after the relationship ends.
3. Only the onboarding operations team may approve a case; RMs may not approve their own clients.
4. Customer data must stay in the EU.
